  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "At the Pokémon League, you’ll get\n",
        "tested by the Elite Four.\f",
        "You have to beat them all.\r",
        "If you lose, you have to start\n",
        "all over!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Some Trainers suddenly feel\n",
        "discouraged and leave.\r",
        "My Abra can take you home.\n",
        "But...\r",
        "Trainers just Fly home lately...\n",
        "I feel left out.\f",
        "I am sure my Abra feels the same way."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_00002",
      "en_US": "Abra: AAbra..."
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Hold it.\r",
        "You’re going to take the Pokémon\n",
        "League challenge now?\r",
        "You’ll have to give up on that.\r",
        "My well-trained-beyond-recognition\n",
        "Pokémon are going to pound you.\r",
        "Right now, right here!\n",
        "I challenge you!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: ...Oh, no... I still can’t\n",
        "win after all that training...\r",
        "I...I have to believe more in my\n",
        "Pokémon...\r",
        "...No big deal.\n",
        "Sorry to have got in the way.\r",
        "Don’t forget to rest your Pokémon\n",
        "before you challenge the Champion!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Once you enter this door, you will be\n",
        "facing the Elite Four.\r",
        "They are really tough!\n",
        "You cannot exit once you enter.\r",
        "The Pokémon helpers aside will let you\n",
        "move as you please through the rooms,\f",
        "but you must defeat all of the\f",
        "Elite Four to challenge the Champion!\r",
        "Are you ready?\f",
        "Be courageous and go for it!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0522_T10R0101_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Once you enter this door, you will be\n",
